    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.mp4?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actors, writers, producers, are getting murdered one by one in cold blood. No one is safe. Who is pulling the strings behind these apparently unrelated murders?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VARIED AND REALISTIC CAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-dealing, backstabbing, betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems in the world of stars. Take a peek behind the curtains, learn what's going on behind the glistering fa\u00e7ade. Meet a varied cast of characters, discover their secrets and ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... they may end up in a body bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEDUCTIVE GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine the crime scene, find clues, piece together what happened, find the culprit! Reveal what's the true reason behind these\u00a0<strong>Confidential Killings</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1227d4e45dd84d80d6d0fb76b373e016.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1227d4e45dd84d80d6d0fb76b373e016.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1227d4e45dd84d80d6d0fb76b373e016.mp4?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/72bce84ab4257af1fe02e0293e007969.mp4?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actors, writers, producers, are getting murdered one by one in cold blood. No one is safe. Who is pulling the strings behind these apparently unrelated murders?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.poster.avif?t=1754726210\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.webm?t=1754726210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VARIED AND REALISTIC CAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-dealing, backstabbing, betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems in the world of stars. Take a peek behind the curtains, learn what's going on behind the glistering fa\u00e7ade. Meet a varied cast of characters, discover their secrets and ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... they may end up in a body bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop plays